 "title": "fix(issue): reject invalid list output flags",
 "description": "`issue list` and `incident list` silently fall back to default rendering for unsupported `--output` or `--output-format` values. Use the existing `cmdutils.NewEnumValue` helper, preserving accepted values, defaults, short flags, and mutual exclusion. Add regression coverage for invalid and empty values on both commands.\n\nResolves #8547\n\nThis replaces !3940 with an identical diff from the community fork so CI can run outside the personal fork. The original MR remains linked for context.\n\nVerification: `go test ./internal/commands/issuable/list -count=1` and `go test -race ./internal/commands/issuable/list -count=1` passed locally with Go 1.27.1 on macOS arm64. `gofmt -d` and `git diff --check` were clean. Community-fork CI: #2864266911.",
